{"title": "Helldusk Armour", "pageid": 8156, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Helldusk_Armour", "categories": ["Bugs", "Heavy Armour", "Legendary items", "Sources of damage reduction", "Gish (hybrid) set", "Perfect Helldusk set", "Sources of Fire damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r349439\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:20px 10%;border-left:10px solid #969696;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:40px}.mw-parser-output table.ambox+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+link+table.ambox,.mw-parser-output table.ambox+style+table.ambox{margin-top:-1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-imageright{padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-notice{border-left-color:#969696}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy{background-color:#400805}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy,.mw-parser-output table.ambox-delete{border-left-color:#b50000}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-content{border-left-color:#de5f16}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-style{border-left-color:#f0c146}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-protection{border-left-color:#4f4a39}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-move{border-left-color:#587cd1}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small{clear:right;float:right;margin:4px 0 4px 1em;box-sizing:border-box;width:238px;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}</style><table class=\"ambox ambox-notice plainlinks metadata\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">Helldusk Armour has a <a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Early_Acquisition_of_Helldusk_Armour\" title=\"Guide:Early Acquisition of Helldusk Armour\">user guide</a>&nbsp;describing how to acquire it in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> through the use of an exploit.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the passive feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Helldusk Armour (passive feature)\">Helldusk Armour (passive feature)</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-legendary\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png/300px-Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/c/cb/Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Helldusk Armour image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png/300px-Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Helldusk_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Helldusk Armour</span></a> is a legendary heavy <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a> which can be worn without any proficiency. It grants Fire resistance, reduces damage by 3 from all sources, and grants the <a href=\"/wiki/Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Fly</a> spell.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Carixim\" title=\"Carixim\">Carixim</a>, soul-stuffed forgemaster of hellish <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a>, hammers away ceaselessly at new creations. Questions of morality and destiny do not concern him. Conscience is for his betters. He works with cheer, his swollen skin moaning soothingly.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: 21\">21</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></div>\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" title=\"Heavy Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy Armour\">Heavy Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Legendary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #B7861D ;\">Legendary</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 20 kg (40 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 20 kg (40 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 8000 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  8000  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7ae705fd-1cfd-4482-a584-d2e68f9c1262</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ae705fd-1cfd-4482-a584-d2e68f9c1262\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ae705fd-1cfd-4482-a584-d2e68f9c1262\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Infernal_Plate_Armor+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(bonus_action)\" title=\"Fly (bonus action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/60px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/80px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/40px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(bonus_action)\" title=\"Fly (bonus action)\">Fly</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Bestow the ability to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a></span> upon yourself. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Armour_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Helldusk Armour (passive feature)\">Helldusk Armour</a></dt><dd>You are considered <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with this armour while wearing it.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Retribution\" title=\"Infernal Retribution\">Infernal Retribution</a></dt><dd>When you succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>, the caster receives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning</a> for 3 turns.</dd></dl><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Prime_Aegis_of_Fire\" title=\"Prime Aegis of Fire\">Prime Aegis of Fire</a></dt><dd>You have <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage and cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burned</a>. You take <b>3</b> less damage from all sources.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-6477&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;2884</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is carried by Raphael at all times. If deprived of it, his armour class remains the same.</li>\n<li>Unlike the spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grant_Flight\" title=\"Grant Flight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/20px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/30px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/40px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grant Flight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/20px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grant_Flight\" title=\"Grant Flight\">Grant Flight</a>, the version of Fly granted by this armour does not require concentration.</li>\n<li>This armour sells for more than any other item in the game.</li>\n<li>As this item does not have a <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> group, any class can wear it without the normal <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> penalties that might otherwise be imposed.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Infernal Retribution:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Infernal Retribution</b> states it applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>, but it actually applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning (Orthonic)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning (Orthonic)</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>As stated above, this item does not have a Proficiency Group (in order for all classes to be 'proficient' with it). However, as a result, items such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\">Bracers of Defence</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Bonespike_Boots_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bonespike_Boots\" title=\"Bonespike Boots\">Bonespike Boots</a>, and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\">Corellon's Grace</a> that are not supposed to give their bonuses while wearing armour still provide their benefits with the Helldusk Armour equipped. The extra movement speed granted to monks by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/38px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/50px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\">Unarmoured Movement</a> is also not lost when wearing this armour.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/38px-Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/50px-Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\">Defence</a> fighting style can grant up to +2 AC when used with this armour. For the same reason as above, Defence does not normally work with the Helldusk Armour as it is not considered armour proper. To work around this, the armour has a hidden passive that grants +1 AC if the wearer has Defence. While this property is not a bug, if the wearer also has another piece of armour equipped (e.g., a helmet), the normal +1 AC from Defence is additionally applied for a total of +2 AC, and this likely <i>is</i> a bug.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 104px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 102px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp/153px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp/230px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/00/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helldusk Armour Human Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp/153px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"102\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 106.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 104.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Back Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp/157px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp/236px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/18/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helldusk Armour Human Back\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp/157px-Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"105\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Helldusk_Armour_Human_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 1 Back <br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 118px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 116px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 4 Front High Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp/174px-Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp/262px-Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp 1.5x, /w/images/6/65/Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helldusk Armour High Elf Front\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp/174px-Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"116\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Body Type 4 Front <br><a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 121.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 119.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Helldusk_Armour_High_Elf_Back_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 4 Back High Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Helldu